<!--
  shiroikuma-rindenwa fork — the colour ROLES, as resources.

  Every name here is one role of the role table in code (shiroikuma/SkRoles.kt). The values in
  this file are PLACEHOLDERS and are never meant to be seen: at run time SkPalette lays a
  resources loader over the app that gives each of these names the colour its role has — the
  value 白い熊 set on the 臨電話 UI page, or the role’s default, which is written in SkRoles.kt and
  nowhere else. A dark magenta ground or a pink ink on the phone therefore means one thing:
  the loader did not reach that surface.

  So: never write a real colour here, and never point XML at a literal. A new coloured thing
  gets a role in SkRoles.kt and, if XML must name it, a placeholder line here.
-->
<resources>
